---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import InstitutionalPage from "../components/InstitutionalPage.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Quest Luxo"
  description="How Quest Luxo collects, uses, protects, retains, and responds to requests about personal information."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <InstitutionalPage
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    intro="This policy explains how Quest Luxo handles information submitted through its website and private client communications."
  >
    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> October 23, 2026</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      We collect information you choose to provide, including your name,
      email address, telephone number, watch interests, budget range, timing,
      and message. We also process limited technical information needed to
      secure the service, such as request time and a privacy-preserving abuse
      prevention identifier.
    </p>

    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>
      We use inquiry information to respond to your request, evaluate sourcing
      requirements, communicate about a potential engagement, protect the
      service from abuse, maintain business records, and meet applicable legal
      obligations. Quest Luxo does not sell personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Service providers and disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Information may be processed by hosting, email, security, and professional
      service providers acting for Quest Luxo. We may also disclose information
      when required by law, to protect rights or safety, or in connection with
      a legitimate corporate transaction.
    </p>

    <h2>Inquiry follow-up and CRM</h2>
    <p>
      We use HubSpot as a customer relationship management service. Confirmed
      website inquiry notifications may be processed through our connected
      Google Workspace and ChatGPT Work tools to create or reuse a contact
      record and assign an internal follow-up task. This workflow uses the
      inquiry email address, division, request category, source receipt and
      follow-up status. Detailed watch budgets and messages remain in the
      original inquiry records rather than being copied into task summaries.
      This operational processing is separate from optional website analytics
      and does not subscribe you to marketing.
    </p>

    <h2>Optional website analytics</h2>
    <p>
      With your permission, we use Google Analytics 4 and Apollo to understand
      page visits, business interest, and opportunities to improve the site.
      This may involve analytics cookies and sharing technical usage information
      with Google and Apollo. Contact-level visitor identification in Apollo is
      disabled. We do not intentionally send
      inquiry text, personal contact details, or submitted watch budgets to
      analytics. Analytics remains off until you choose to allow it. Apollo is
      not loaded on private operator pages or URLs containing query strings
      or fragments. A previous Google-only analytics choice does not authorize
      the newly added service; the site asks for an updated choice.
    </p>
    <p>
      Your choice is saved in your browser and can be changed by selecting
      <button type="button" data-ql-analytics-preferences>Review analytics preferences</button>.
      Declining analytics does not prevent you from using the website or
      submitting an inquiry.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention and security</h2>
    <p>
      General inquiries are retained for up to 24 months unless a longer period
      is reasonably required for an active engagement, fraud prevention,
      dispute resolution, or legal compliance. We apply access controls,
      transport encryption, restricted production storage, and audit logging
      proportionate to the information processed.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices and requests</h2>
    <p>
      You may request access, correction, or deletion of inquiry information,
      subject to applicable law and legitimate recordkeeping needs. Email
      <a href="mailto:privacy@questluxo.com">privacy@questluxo.com</a>. We may
      need to verify your identity before completing a request.
    </p>

    <h2>Updates and contact</h2>
    <p>
      Material changes will be reflected by an updated effective date. Privacy
      questions may be directed to
      <a href="mailto:privacy@questluxo.com">privacy@questluxo.com</a>.
    </p>
  </InstitutionalPage>
</BaseLayout>
